Third-party dependencies (not included in this repository)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Semantic Scholar MCP server (akapet00/semantic-scholar-mcp), invoked as an
  external dependency via .mcp.json and run with uvx. It is not part of this
  repository and remains under its own license.
  https://github.com/akapet00/semantic-scholar-mcp

- Paper metadata is provided by Semantic Scholar.
  https://www.semanticscholar.org/

- The markdown-to-word skill calls Pandoc (GPL-2.0-or-later) through pypandoc
  (MIT). Neither Pandoc nor its binaries are bundled in this repository; the
  user installs them separately via conda-forge. Because the Pandoc binary is
  not distributed as part of this suite, its GPL terms do not propagate to
  Paperdoku's own CC BY-NC 4.0 content.
  https://pandoc.org/  https://github.com/JessicaTegner/pypandoc
